{"version":1,"key":"card:397","content":{"id":397,"content":[{"children":[{"highlight":"red","text":"当我们对系统的某个部分进行加速时，对系统整体的加速效果取决于该部分的占比以及加速程度。","type":"formatted"},{"text":"假设该部分占比为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"\\alpha","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"20058dc4-8d17-4fdb-954e-aac9798dc403","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\alpha","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿，速度提升为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"k","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"358615e6-0279-48c3-a28f-ad4a097b1890","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"k","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿，考虑原来的运行时间为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"T_{\\text{old}}","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"613548f8-ba20-47ab-a3ae-00692471b671","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"T_{\\text{old}}","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿，那么加速后的运行时间为","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"138e0080-4ec2-451d-a35c-0521c3fef4d2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8d60389b-b98c-42b3-b690-627caddffc3c","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"T_{\\text{new}} = (1 - \\alpha) T_{\\text{old}} + \\alpha \\frac{T_{\\text{old}}}{k} = (1 - \\alpha + \\alpha/k) T_{\\text{old}}","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"那么系统整体的加速比为","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"211c5c5d-d610-4960-b04c-ae1aba016aaf","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"16f21d2b-5bd7-410b-8fab-347d20e780c4","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"S = \\frac{T_{\\text{old}}}{T_{\\text{new}}} = \\frac{1}{1 - \\alpha + \\alpha / k}","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"这个定律被称为 Amdahl 定律。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"45575425-560e-406a-b71b-e289dd4e3dcf","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"假设该部件占比为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"\\alpha = 60\\%","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"52c567a3-eb34-4709-83f4-32f74508686b","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\alpha = 60\\%","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"，速度提升为原来的 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"k = 2","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1b7e3910-861c-4dbf-b8b6-abab645349d6","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"k = 2","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 倍，那么系统的整体提升为","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1b043d26-28a1-4d02-b091-4db696f75377","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7065ce07-f42b-4871-b20d-d39039c96741","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"S = \\frac{1}{1 - 0.6 + 0.6 / 2} = 1.428","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"整体的加速比小于某部分的加速比，如下想显著提升系统整体的速度，那就需要改善系统绝大部分组件的速度。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7132e82c-56dc-4390-b546-54e39e87d920","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"考虑一个极端的情况，假设对系统某个部件的速度改善到了极致，即 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"k \\rightarrow \\inf","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"43a8d060-fec6-486a-bef8-1ee1979bedb0","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"k \\rightarrow \\infty","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿，系统此时整体的加速比为","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"05623e5c-aa15-493c-ac39-bf0b80f2e606","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"13cce01f-f288-4200-b7fa-9d0d56d00260","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"S = \\frac{1}{1 - \\alpha}","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"假设这部分的占比为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"60%","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b4083ff7-503b-40ed-9d6a-965e63c90f27","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"60\\%","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"，那么系统的加速比为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":" = 2.5","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5a38f8df-3882-44fc-8c42-9fb896c6a1f5","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":" S= 2.5","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿，即使我们对某一点进行了极致的优化，系统整体加速比的提升并没有想象的那么明显，要得到更好的加速比，我们必须优化系统中的大部分组件。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a49b70cf-933a-45e2-81c6-396826266113","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":["Amdahl 定律"],"createTime":1704901957560,"updateTime":1793532524022,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532524022}}